是啊。

473
00:20:29.310 --> 00:20:31.430
So I think they use different takes in their cut.
所以我认为他们在剪辑时用了不同的镜头。

474
00:20:31.610 --> 00:20:33.490
But I go from having dirt to no dirt.
但我从有泥土变成没有泥土了。

475
00:20:33.930 --> 00:20:35.910
Well, Brian and I got direct hits.
嗯，我和布赖恩可是结结实实挨了一下。

476
00:20:37.650 --> 00:20:38.210
All right.
好吧。

477
00:20:38.310 --> 00:20:40.890
Well, now this episode is going to begin.
好了，现在这一集要开始了。

478
00:20:41.530 --> 00:20:44.970
Dwight and Mose are on the front porch as Mose plays guitar.
德怀特和莫斯在前廊上，莫斯在弹吉他。

479
00:20:44.970 --> 00:20:46.450
He's playing Oklahoma.
他在弹奏《俄克拉荷马》。

480
00:20:47.390 --> 00:20:49.570
I have how it was described in the shooting draft.
我这有拍摄剧本里的描述。

481
00:20:49.690 --> 00:20:50.310
Would you like to hear it?
你想听吗？

482
00:20:50.350 --> 00:20:50.610
I would.
我想听。

483
00:20:50.990 --> 00:20:51.810
What if you said no?
如果你说不想听呢？

484
00:20:53.670 --> 00:20:55.330
Then you would not be able to read it.
那你就没法读了。

485
00:20:55.330 --> 00:20:56.010
Why do we ask?
我们为什么还要问？

486
00:20:56.150 --> 00:20:56.410
I know.
就是说啊。

487
00:20:56.530 --> 00:20:57.270
We do it all the time.
我们总是这样。

488
00:20:57.370 --> 00:20:58.290
You're like, do you want to hear a summary?
就像你会问，你想听总结吗？

489
00:20:58.590 --> 00:20:58.890
Yeah.
好啊。

490
00:20:59.050 --> 00:20:59.250
Okay.
行。

491
00:20:59.390 --> 00:20:59.670
Sure.
当然。

492
00:21:00.330 --> 00:21:01.190
Here's what it said.
上面是这么写的。

493
00:21:01.570 --> 00:21:06.010
Dwight wearing funeral clothes paces nervously on the front porch, checking his watch.
穿着葬礼服装的德怀特在前廊上紧张地踱步，看着手表。

494
00:21:06.450 --> 00:21:11.010
Mose on the bench swing plays guitar, slowly picking out, oh, what a beautiful morning
莫斯在长椅秋千上弹着吉他，缓缓拨出《俄克拉荷马》中的

495
00:21:11.010 --> 00:21:11.670
from Oklahoma.
《哦，多么美好的早晨》。

496
00:21:11.670 --> 00:21:15.850
Oklahoma Zeke rides up on a 1940s German motorcycle with a sidecar.
俄克拉荷马的齐克骑着一辆四十年代带有边斗的德国摩托车驶来。

497
00:21:16.350 --> 00:21:20.970
Well, I should let everybody know that while Mike Schur, as Mose, makes a brief appearance
嗯，我应该告诉大家，虽然迈克·舒尔作为莫斯在本集中短暂出现，

498
00:21:20.970 --> 00:21:25.650
in this episode, he would not have been a regular character on the spinoff of The Farm.
但他不会成为衍生剧《农场》的常驻角色。

499
00:21:26.030 --> 00:21:30.970
You know, it's interesting because in the script, they found a creative way to make sure
你知道，这很有趣，因为在剧本中，他们想出一个巧妙的方法来确保

500
00:21:30.970 --> 00:21:33.310
he didn't have to be on any other day but this day.
他除了这一天之外，不用在任何其他日子出镜。

501
00:21:33.750 --> 00:21:34.090
Really?
真的吗？

502
00:21:34.090 --> 00:21:34.430
Yeah.
对。

503
00:21:34.750 --> 00:21:36.550
So this is how it read in the shooting draft.
所以拍摄剧本里就是这么写的。

504
00:21:36.790 --> 00:21:38.070
Dwight walks to the motorcycle.
德怀特走向摩托车。

505
00:21:38.570 --> 00:21:40.170
Mose stays put and Dwight notices.
莫斯呆在原地，德怀特注意到了。

506
00:21:40.450 --> 00:21:41.430
Dwight says, you coming?
德怀特说，你来不来？

507
00:21:41.690 --> 00:21:43.670
Mose says, will there be ghosts there?
莫斯说，那儿会有鬼吗？

508
00:21:44.110 --> 00:21:46.230
Dwight says, you know, I can't say for sure.
德怀特说，这个嘛，我不敢打包票。

509
00:21:46.630 --> 00:21:48.190
Mose says, I better not risk it.
莫斯说，我还是别冒这个险了。

510
00:21:48.850 --> 00:21:49.970
So he doesn't go.
所以他没去。

511
00:21:50.370 --> 00:21:55.210
Well, Zeke, who was played by Matt Jones, would have been a regular character on the show.
嗯，由马特·琼斯饰演的齐克本会是剧中的常规角色。

512
00:21:55.430 --> 00:21:58.750
You know, we originally introduced him in the Junior Salesman episode.
你知道的，我们最初是在《初级推销员》那一集里引入这个角色的。

513
00:21:58.750 --> 00:22:02.910
That's when Dwight is trying to hire one of his friends to work in the office.
那是德怀特试图雇佣他的一个朋友来办公室工作的时候。

514
00:22:03.490 --> 00:22:06.990
We filmed Junior Salesman after The Farm.
我们在《农场》之后拍摄了《初级推销员》。

515
00:22:07.470 --> 00:22:07.990
Oh.
哦。

516
00:22:08.250 --> 00:22:08.650
Mm-hmm.
嗯哼。

517
00:22:08.810 --> 00:22:11.250
And we will also see the character of Zeke in the finale.
而且我们还会在大结局中看到齐克这个角色。

518
00:22:12.050 --> 00:22:14.930
I thought maybe you would want a location breakdown.
我想你可能想要一份外景解析。

519
00:22:15.190 --> 00:22:17.170
I always want a location breakdown.
我一直都想要外景解析。

520
00:22:17.410 --> 00:22:17.690
Yes.
是的。

521
00:22:17.890 --> 00:22:21.470
So, you know, as Dwight and Zeke are bickering over who's going to sit in the sidecar,
所以，你知道的，当德怀特和齐克在争论谁来坐边斗时，

522
00:22:21.730 --> 00:22:28.610
I noticed they were squinting quite a bit from the blazing sun that was beating down on them.
我注意到他们被当空直射的烈日晒得直眯眼睛。

523
00:22:29.530 --> 00:22:32.950
So I thought maybe I would give you all a location breakdown.
所以我琢磨着也许我该给你们大家做个外景解析。

524
00:22:33.250 --> 00:22:35.590
We filmed the farm at the Disney Ranch.
我们在迪士尼牧场拍摄了农场。

525
00:22:35.830 --> 00:22:37.850
This is the same place as Shroop FarMs.
这地方和施鲁普农场是同一个地方。

526
00:22:38.010 --> 00:22:41.950
Like you said before, Angela, we filmed this at the end of August, beginning of September,
正如你刚才所说，安吉拉，我们是在八月底、九月初拍的这部分，

527
00:22:42.190 --> 00:22:45.930
and Steve Burgess said he remembered it was very hot.
史蒂夫·伯吉斯说他记得当时非常热。

528
00:22:46.670 --> 00:22:49.750
We also shot this episode for seven days.
我们这一集也拍了七天。

529
00:22:50.170 --> 00:22:53.830
A normal office episode, we would only get five days.
如果是平常的办公室那一集，我们只有五天时间。

530
00:22:53.830 --> 00:22:54.090
Mm-hmm.
嗯哼。

531
00:22:54.190 --> 00:22:58.230
But they usually give you more time to shoot a pilot episode because creatively,
但他们通常会给你更多时间来拍试播集，因为从创意角度来说，

532
00:22:58.790 --> 00:23:02.950
you want that extra time so you can do more takes, you can figure things out,
你需要这额外的时间来多拍几条，琢磨清楚状况，

533
00:23:03.110 --> 00:23:07.510
maybe rewrite things in the moment, because you're kind of still getting your bearings.
甚至可能在现场临时重写，因为你还在摸索方向。

534
00:23:07.510 --> 00:23:07.830
Yeah.
是啊。

535
00:23:08.250 --> 00:23:13.470
Well, Steve also shared with us a memo that he sent out to the cast and crew.
嗯，史蒂夫还跟我们分享了一份他发给演员和剧组人员的备忘录。

536
00:23:13.690 --> 00:23:14.790
Oh my gosh, I saw this.
哦天哪，我看到这个了。

537
00:23:14.930 --> 00:23:15.810
This is so great.
这太棒了。

538
00:23:15.910 --> 00:23:16.590
I'm going to read it.
我要把它读出来。

539
00:23:16.590 --> 00:23:22.070
Some things to remember when on location for episode 9005, The Farm.
在第9005集《农场》的外景地时需要记住的一些事情。

540
00:23:22.530 --> 00:23:25.670
We will be working in desert-like conditions.
我们将在沙漠般的环境中工作。

541
00:23:26.050 --> 00:23:29.470
During the day, we expect temperatures to exceed 90 degrees.
白天预计气温将超过90华氏度。

542
00:23:29.870 --> 00:23:30.890
Please stay hydrated.
请注意补充水分。

543
00:23:31.410 --> 00:23:34.110
Electrolytes and sunscreen will be available with the medic.
医务人员处将提供电解质饮料和防晒霜。

544
00:23:34.490 --> 00:23:37.390
Buckets of ice water will be available around set.
片场四周将放置冰水桶。

545
00:23:37.570 --> 00:23:41.050
At night and next week in the early morning hours, we will have cooler temperatures,
夜间以及下周清晨时分气温较低，

546
00:23:41.050 --> 00:23:43.790
so please bring layers so you can stay warm.
所以请带上保暖衣物以便御寒。

547
00:23:43.950 --> 00:23:45.290
This next paragraph.
接下来的这一段。

548
00:23:45.890 --> 00:23:49.230
Critters have been found in high volume around location.
外景地周围发现了大量的小动物。

549
00:23:49.510 --> 00:23:52.850
We have a full-time critter wrangler working with us.
我们有一位全职的动物驯养员与我们合作。

550
00:23:52.950 --> 00:23:58.170
If you suspect there are critters in your area you are heading to, are currently working in,
如果您怀疑您正要前往或当前所在的区域有小动物出没，

551
00:23:58.530 --> 00:24:02.210
please notify the wrangler and have him inspect the area.
请通知动物管理员，让他来检查一下这片区域。

552
00:24:02.530 --> 00:24:07.890
Despite the high temperatures, we encourage you to wear long pants and closed-toed protective shoes.
尽管气温很高，我们仍然建议您穿长裤和包头防护鞋。

553
00:24:08.450 --> 00:24:10.770
This area has been known to have bees.
众所周知，这个区域有蜜蜂出没。

554
00:24:11.030 --> 00:24:11.930
Please alert the medic.
请提醒医护人员。

555
00:24:12.090 --> 00:24:12.870
Oh my gosh!
我的天哪！

556
00:24:13.030 --> 00:24:14.190
Critters and now bees!
先是小动物，现在连蜜蜂都有了！

557
00:24:14.430 --> 00:24:16.170
Please alert the medic if you are allergic.
如果您对蜜蜂过敏，请提醒医护人员。

558
00:24:16.430 --> 00:24:20.370
Be prepared and bring your EpiPen with you every day in case of an emergency.
请做好准备，每天随身携带肾上腺素自动注射笔以防万一。

559
00:24:21.010 --> 00:24:26.370
This is the same location where John bit into his scrambled eggs and bit into a bee.
这里就是约翰吃炒鸡蛋时咬到蜜蜂的同一个地方。

560
00:24:26.570 --> 00:24:26.850
Remember?
还记得吗？

561
00:24:27.110 --> 00:24:28.350
Yes, during garden party.
记得，在花园派对期间。

562
00:24:28.490 --> 00:24:28.730
Yes.
对。

563
00:24:29.150 --> 00:24:33.970
Lady, I'll have you know, I've started reading the back of the call sheets.
这位女士，不妨告诉你，我已经开始阅读通告单的背面了。

564
00:24:34.150 --> 00:24:35.010
Oh, they're delicious.
哦，它们太美味了。

565
00:24:35.610 --> 00:24:39.950
It's a list of every crew member and what time they needed to arrive on set.
上面列出了每位剧组人员以及他们需要到达片场的时间。

566
00:24:40.410 --> 00:24:43.530
By Wednesday, we had two critter wranglers.
到了周三，我们有两个动物管理员。

567
00:24:43.730 --> 00:24:44.230
Oh gosh.
哦天哪。

568
00:24:44.330 --> 00:24:44.790
Not one.
不是一个。

569
00:24:44.910 --> 00:24:47.190
They had to add an extra critter wrangler.
他们不得不增加一个额外的动物管理员。

570
00:24:47.250 --> 00:24:47.710
Because they probably found more.
因为他们可能发现了更多。

571
00:24:47.790 --> 00:24:48.290
I know!
我知道！

572
00:24:48.770 --> 00:24:49.550
All right.
好的。

573
00:24:49.730 --> 00:24:55.870
Everyone has arrived at the burial site, including Oscar, who Dwight forgot he had invited.
所有人都到达了墓地，包括奥斯卡，德怀特忘记自己曾邀请过他。

574
00:24:56.150 --> 00:24:56.350
Yeah.
是啊。

575
00:24:56.350 --> 00:25:03.930
This is when Dwight's brother, Jeb, arrives in a red sports car, which he sort of drives
这时德怀特的哥哥杰布开着一辆红色跑车赶到，他一路开得

576
00:25:03.930 --> 00:25:05.150
into the grave.
冲进了墓穴里。

577
00:25:05.490 --> 00:25:05.830
Yeah.
对。

578
00:25:06.030 --> 00:25:08.390
It was described like this in the shooting draft.
拍摄剧本里就是这样描述的。

579
00:25:08.470 --> 00:25:08.710
Okay.
好吧。

580
00:25:08.950 --> 00:25:11.230
A rented Mustang drives up way too faSt.
一辆租来的野马轿车车速极快地开了过来。

581
00:25:11.410 --> 00:25:16.350
The driver, Jeb, is excited to see Dwight and is waving and honking and not paying attention
司机杰布看到德怀特非常兴奋，一边挥手一边按喇叭，根本没注意

582
00:25:16.350 --> 00:25:17.110
to where he's going.
他要开去哪里。

583
00:25:17.330 --> 00:25:20.550
He drives right into the grave, getting the front corner wheel stuck.
他直接把车开进了墓穴里，前轮卡住了。

584
00:25:20.550 --> 00:25:24.970
He smiles and then gets out of the car.
他微笑着下了车。

585
00:25:25.350 --> 00:25:26.250
And they hug.
然后他们拥抱了。

586
00:25:26.510 --> 00:25:26.650
Yeah.
对。

587
00:25:27.030 --> 00:25:29.310
Jeb and Dwight seem very happy to see one another.
杰布和德怀特看起来很高兴见到彼此。

588
00:25:29.690 --> 00:25:30.050
Yeah.
是啊。

589
00:25:30.170 --> 00:25:32.970
They start wrestling and almost shoving each other into the grave site.
他们开始摔跤，差点把对方推到墓穴里。

590
00:25:33.150 --> 00:25:33.470
Mm-hmm.
嗯哼。

591
00:25:33.950 --> 00:25:34.290
Lady?
女士？

592
00:25:34.690 --> 00:25:35.210
Yes?
什么事？

593
00:25:35.550 --> 00:25:39.950
I have five bulls**t cards to play for this episode.
这一集我有五张胡说八道卡要出。

594
00:25:40.150 --> 00:25:40.610
Oh my goodness!
噢我的天啊！

595
00:25:40.890 --> 00:25:42.870
I was not expecting you to say that!
我没想到你会这么说！

596
00:25:42.870 --> 00:25:46.230
I probably could have more, but I narrowed it down to five.
我本来可以有更多的，但我把它精简到了五张。

597
00:25:46.890 --> 00:25:49.730
And I even made my own bulls**t cards.
我甚至还自己制作了胡说八道卡。

598
00:25:50.090 --> 00:25:50.370
What?
什么？

599
00:25:50.830 --> 00:25:51.790
Josh, help me.
乔什，救救我。

600
00:25:52.110 --> 00:25:53.510
Let me grab my deck.
让我拿一下我的牌组。

601
00:25:54.170 --> 00:25:56.730
Oh, it's a deck of cards.
哦，这是一副牌。

602
00:25:56.990 --> 00:25:57.390
Uh-huh.
嗯哼。

603
00:25:57.390 --> 00:25:58.950
This is like a magic trick now.
这现在就像是个魔术了。

604
00:25:59.090 --> 00:26:01.370
Well, there are five cards in here.
好吧，这里面有五张牌。

605
00:26:01.530 --> 00:26:02.290
I don't want to reveal.
我不想剧透。

606
00:26:02.410 --> 00:26:03.890
Let me make sure I have my right one.
让我确认一下我拿的是不是对的。

607
00:26:04.710 --> 00:26:05.190
Okay.
好的。

608
00:26:05.810 --> 00:26:06.570
One second.
等一下。

609
00:26:06.850 --> 00:26:08.510
This is also a royal flush.
这也是一副皇家同花顺。

610
00:26:08.730 --> 00:26:09.050
If you...
如果你……

611
00:26:09.050 --> 00:26:09.450
Oh, yes!
噢，太对了！

612
00:26:09.450 --> 00:26:10.370
I did that on purpose!
我是故意这么做的！

613
00:26:10.710 --> 00:26:11.950
Thank you for noticing!
谢谢你注意到！

614
00:26:12.870 --> 00:26:15.010
I have a royal flush of bulls**t cards.
我有一副全是胡扯牌的皇家同花顺。

615
00:26:15.130 --> 00:26:16.110
I was going to say that.
我本来想这么说来着。

616
00:26:16.230 --> 00:26:17.790
But you're such a good card player.
但你牌技实在太好了。

617
00:26:17.790 --> 00:26:18.570
You beat me to it.
你抢在我前面说了。

618
00:26:18.690 --> 00:26:18.810
Okay.
好吧。

619
00:26:18.950 --> 00:26:21.370
I have my first bulls**t card I'm going to play.
我要打出我的第一张胡扯牌了。

620
00:26:21.370 --> 00:26:22.970
It's the Queen of Hearts, everyone.
各位，这是红桃Q。

621
00:26:23.210 --> 00:26:24.150
It's the Queen of Hearts.
这就是红桃Q。

622
00:26:26.450 --> 00:26:27.290
Here it is.
给你。

623
00:26:28.090 --> 00:26:30.670
Jenna, I want you to describe my bulls**t card.
珍娜，我想让你描述一下我的胡扯牌。

624
00:26:30.990 --> 00:26:32.990
Oh my God, this is amazing.
哦天哪，这太棒了。

625
00:26:33.650 --> 00:26:38.170
Everyone, I wish now our podcast was on video just for this one moment.
各位，我真希望我们的播客现在能有视频，就为了这一个时刻。

626
00:26:38.290 --> 00:26:40.270
Please go to Office Ladies Pod.
请去关注 Office Ladies Pod。

627
00:26:40.590 --> 00:26:41.370
I'll share.
我会分享的。

628
00:26:41.370 --> 00:26:43.170
She will share these bulls**t cards.
她会分享这些胡扯牌的。

629
00:26:43.390 --> 00:26:43.990
It says,
上面写着，

630
00:26:44.610 --> 00:26:45.210
Bulls**t!
胡扯！

631
00:26:45.310 --> 00:26:46.330
Where's Angela?
安吉拉在哪？

632
00:26:46.610 --> 00:26:50.290
And it's a picture of Aunt Shirley and Angela together.
上面是一张雪莉阿姨和安吉拉在一起的照片。

633
00:26:50.510 --> 00:26:52.050
Smiling at one another.
彼此微笑着。

634
00:26:52.230 --> 00:26:52.510
Mm-hmm.
嗯哼。

635
00:26:52.670 --> 00:26:55.130
At the meal Angela cooked for her.
在安吉拉为她做饭的时候。

636
00:26:55.290 --> 00:26:55.570
Mm-hmm.
嗯哼。

637
00:26:55.710 --> 00:26:59.090
After she had bathed her in Moving On Part 2.
在她在《重整旗鼓（下）》里帮她洗过澡之后。

638
00:26:59.770 --> 00:27:02.110
This is really, really incredible.
这真的是太不可思议了。

639
00:27:02.430 --> 00:27:06.650
You know, you aren't the only person who would like to play this bulls**t card.
你知道的，想打这张胡扯牌的不止你一个人。

640
00:27:06.650 --> 00:27:09.370
This was a fan mail flurry.
这是一波狂热的粉丝来信。

641
00:27:09.770 --> 00:27:13.290
Starting with Ludovico from Zurich.
从苏黎世的鲁多维科开始。

642
00:27:13.450 --> 00:27:15.050
Oh, Ludovico, thank you.
哦，鲁多维科，谢谢你。

643
00:27:15.350 --> 00:27:21.190
I'm surprised that Dwight didn't invite Pam or even Angela, who helped in his aunt's last moment.
我很惊讶德怀特没有邀请帕姆，甚至没有邀请在阿姨临终前帮忙的安吉拉。

644
00:27:21.310 --> 00:27:21.910
Thank you!
谢谢你！

645
00:27:22.190 --> 00:27:25.990
Can you explain why so little of the cast goes to the funeral?
你能解释一下为什么只有这么少的主演去参加葬礼吗？

646
00:27:26.610 --> 00:27:28.110
And then we have Nick N.
然后我们还有来自

647
00:27:28.270 --> 00:27:28.850
from Minnesota.
明尼苏达州的尼克·N。

648
00:27:29.530 --> 00:27:34.030
My big question here is, how was Angela meant to fit into this backdoor pilot?
我这里最大的疑问是，安吉拉原本打算怎么融入这个衍生剧的试播集？

649
00:27:34.350 --> 00:27:37.590
If it had been picked up, would Angela have been part of that show?
如果它被选上了，安吉拉会成为那个节目的一部分吗？

650
00:27:38.110 --> 00:27:44.190
I'm very interested to know what Dwight and Angela's future on The Office would have looked like if the farm had been picked up.
我非常想知道，如果农场剧被选上了，德怀特和安吉拉在《办公室》里的未来会是什么样子的。

651
00:27:44.290 --> 00:27:44.990
Oh, Nick.
哦，尼克。

652
00:27:44.990 --> 00:27:46.470
And then Jessica V.
然后来自英国的杰西卡·V.

653
00:27:46.750 --> 00:27:52.170
from England said, I read that the farm was going to be a spinoff show for Dwight and his family on the farm.
说，我看到报道说这个农场将会是德怀特和他在农场的家人的一部衍生剧。

654
00:27:52.450 --> 00:27:57.790
Angela, would you have been on this series, too, as Dwight obviously eventually married Angela?
安吉拉，既然德怀特显然最终娶了安吉拉，你会不会也出演这部剧呢？

655
00:27:58.150 --> 00:28:01.090
Were you contacted about signing on for this series?
你们有联系过让你们签约这部剧吗？

656
00:28:01.710 --> 00:28:03.410
I love this fan mail flurry.
我太喜欢这股粉丝来信的狂潮了。

657
00:28:03.630 --> 00:28:05.370
I have some answers for you all.
我有一些答案要给你们大家。

658
00:28:05.570 --> 00:28:05.810
Yes.
是的。

659
00:28:05.810 --> 00:28:12.650
So, Jessica, I wasn't contacted about the series, but one day Rain reached out to me.
所以，杰西卡，我没有收到关于这部剧的联系，但有一天雷恩联系了我。

660
00:28:12.870 --> 00:28:15.130
He said, Angela, I'd love to talk to you about the farm.
他说，安吉拉，我想跟你聊聊关于农场的事。

661
00:28:15.690 --> 00:28:18.050
And I went to his trailer on my lunch break.
然后我在午休时去了他的房车。

662
00:28:18.150 --> 00:28:21.910
And he said, listen, he said, Ange, I'm going to do this show.
他说，听着，他说，安吉，我要去做这个节目了。

663
00:28:22.810 --> 00:28:28.990
And he said, you know, I sort of saw your character like Lilith for the Frasier spinoff.
他说，你知道的，我有点把你的角色看作《欢乐一家亲》衍生剧里的莉莉丝。

664
00:28:29.150 --> 00:28:34.070
You know, where Lilith is the mother of Frasier's child and she pops in every once in a while.
你知道的，莉莉丝是frasier的孩子的母亲，她偶尔会出现一次。

665
00:28:34.070 --> 00:28:38.170
But really, the show is about this new journey that Frasier's on.
但实际上，这部剧讲的是frasier踏上的新旅程。

666
00:28:38.790 --> 00:28:41.710
And that's how Rain told me he envisioned the show.
这就是雷恩告诉我他构想这部剧的方式。

667
00:28:41.930 --> 00:28:43.750
They ended up not going that way.
他们最后没有走那条路。

668
00:28:43.870 --> 00:28:51.310
They ended up wanting to have a clean break, that Dwight would be part of a whole new world, his family, on the farm.
他们最终希望有一个完全的了断，德怀特将成为一个全新世界的一部分，也就是他在农场的家人。

669
00:28:51.330 --> 00:28:56.750
And they really didn't want my character kind of bogging down Dwight's future.
他们其实并不希望我的角色拖累德怀特的未来。

670
00:28:57.610 --> 00:29:02.530
So my character did not go to the funeral and was not included in the farm pilot.
所以我的角色没有去参加葬礼，也没有被纳入农场的试播集中。

671
00:29:02.530 --> 00:29:04.090
And here's what I think.
以下是我的想法。

672
00:29:04.250 --> 00:29:11.990
I think that if this episode and this story of Aunt Shirley's funeral was just an office episode from the beginning,
我认为，如果这集以及雪莉阿姨葬礼这个故事从一开始就是《办公室》的一集，

673
00:29:12.310 --> 00:29:16.130
I think Pam and Angela would have been invited to this funeral.
我想帕姆和安吉拉会被邀请参加这个葬礼的。

674
00:29:16.430 --> 00:29:19.010
You would have seen more office people at this funeral.
你会在这场葬礼上看到更多办公室的人。

675
00:29:19.170 --> 00:29:19.490
Exactly.
没错。

676
00:29:19.490 --> 00:29:21.950
If it wasn't written to be a spinoff.
如果它不是为了拍成衍生剧而写的。

677
00:29:21.950 --> 00:29:22.410
Exactly.
没错。

678
00:29:22.950 --> 00:29:28.390
There was actually a lot of the first half of season nine, particularly with the character of Dwight,
实际上，第九季的前半部分有很多内容，特别是关于德怀特这个角色的，

679
00:29:28.530 --> 00:29:32.710
that was written with the idea that his character would be leaving in the middle of the season.
在写的时候就带着他会在季中离开的想法。

680
00:29:33.190 --> 00:29:36.470
And all of that had to be changed when the farm didn't move forward.
当农场项目没能推进时，所有这些都不得不改变。

681
00:29:36.670 --> 00:29:42.710
Like, for example, the fact that the DNA test came back saying that Dwight was not Philip's father.
比如，DNA检测结果显示德怀特不是菲利普的父亲这件事。

682
00:29:42.710 --> 00:29:51.330
That was done only because they were sort of already writing toward this idea that there was going to be this spinoff.
那样做完全是因为他们已经在朝着将要推出这个衍生剧的想法进行创作了。

683
00:29:51.490 --> 00:29:51.590
Right.
没错。

684
00:29:51.710 --> 00:29:53.590
And Dwight and Angela needed a clean break.
而且德怀特和安吉拉需要彻底了断。

685
00:29:53.830 --> 00:29:54.350
Exactly.
没错。

686
00:29:54.810 --> 00:29:56.990
You know, there was also that plot line.
你知道的，当时还有那个情节线。

687
00:29:57.130 --> 00:30:00.630
Remember when Dwight finds the pills and he starts taking them?
还记得德怀特找到药片并开始服用的时候吗？

688
00:30:00.830 --> 00:30:02.330
He was depressed at work.
他在工作中很沮丧。

689
00:30:02.530 --> 00:30:02.790
Yes.
是的。

690
00:30:02.790 --> 00:30:04.250
He was looking for a change.
他在寻找改变。

691
00:30:04.370 --> 00:30:07.990
All of that was going to support him leaving Dunder Mifflin.
所有这些都是为了支撑他离开邓德米夫林。

692
00:30:07.990 --> 00:30:13.950
And remember, everybody, moving on, that was written after the farm.
大家请记住，接下来的《整装待发》，那是农场之后写的。

693
00:30:14.250 --> 00:30:19.070
And it was sort of to help give a lead in to this episode.
它有点像是为了帮助引出这一集。

694
00:30:19.610 --> 00:30:23.130
And that's when your relationship with Aunt Shirley forMs.
那就是你和雪莉阿姨的关系建立起来的时候。

695
00:30:23.350 --> 00:30:25.210
But they had already filmed the farm.
但他们已经把农场拍完了。

696
00:30:25.530 --> 00:30:27.590
So it's a little clunky.
所以它有点生硬。

697
00:30:27.770 --> 00:30:27.990
Yeah.
是啊。

698
00:30:28.130 --> 00:30:29.750
And it opens a lot of questions.
而且它引发了很多问题。

699
00:30:30.070 --> 00:30:30.290
Yeah.
是的。

700
00:30:30.290 --> 00:30:30.710
I get it.
我懂的。

701
00:30:31.270 --> 00:30:34.270
Well, I have a second bull**** card to play now.
好吧，我现在有第二张胡扯卡要出了。

702
00:30:34.430 --> 00:30:35.130
Oh, my gosh.
噢，天哪。

703
00:30:35.230 --> 00:30:35.770
So quickly.
这么快。

704
00:30:36.010 --> 00:30:36.870
I'm so sorry.
真不好意思。

705
00:30:36.870 --> 00:30:39.010
I love the cards so much.
我太喜欢这些卡片了。

706
00:30:39.130 --> 00:30:40.270
And I can't wait to see this one.
而且我迫不及待想看这张了。

707
00:30:40.850 --> 00:30:41.110
Okay.
好。

708
00:30:41.250 --> 00:30:43.430
Here is my second bull**** card.
这是我的第二张胡扯卡。

709
00:30:43.790 --> 00:30:44.690
Jenna, I'm going to give it to you.
珍娜，我要把它给你。

710
00:30:44.890 --> 00:30:45.210
Okay.
好的。

711
00:30:46.230 --> 00:30:49.410
It just says, bull**** brother?
上面写着，胡扯兄弟？

712
00:30:50.090 --> 00:30:51.510
Two question marks.
两个问号。

713
00:30:51.710 --> 00:30:54.970
And it's a picture of Jeb, Dwight's brother.
上面还有德怀特的兄弟杰布的照片。

714
00:30:55.230 --> 00:30:58.030
Even Oscar is like, you have a brother?
连奥斯卡都一副“你居然有个兄弟？”的表情。

715
00:30:58.410 --> 00:30:58.990
What?
什么？

716
00:30:59.430 --> 00:30:59.810
Yeah.
对。

717
00:31:00.390 --> 00:31:00.610
Yeah.
没错。

718
00:31:00.870 --> 00:31:04.830
Apparently, the farm was not subject to the office show Bible.
显然，那个农场设定不在《办公室》官方设定集里。

719
00:31:05.070 --> 00:31:05.430
No.
没有。

720
00:31:05.430 --> 00:31:09.170
We got to sort of just rewrite some history.
我们差不多是重新改写了一点历史。

721
00:31:09.790 --> 00:31:12.350
I also have two more things for my digital clutter.
我的数字杂物箱里还有两样东西。

722
00:31:12.510 --> 00:31:14.030
My first one was the email from Rain.
第一样是雷恩发的一封邮件。

723
00:31:14.330 --> 00:31:15.610
Here's my second one.
这是我的第二样。

724
00:31:15.910 --> 00:31:19.850
I emailed you, Jenna, and I titled it, Question About Our Schedule.
我给你发了封邮件，珍娜，标题是：关于我们日程的疑问。

725
00:31:20.390 --> 00:31:25.590
And I said, hey, I'm trying to plan a quick Thursday-Sunday trip home to Texas with Isabel.
我说，嘿，我正打算和伊莎贝尔安排一趟从周四到周日回德克萨斯老家的短途旅行。

726
00:31:25.590 --> 00:31:27.110
Well, I'm looking at our schedule.
然后我看了看我们的日程表。

727
00:31:27.350 --> 00:31:29.710
What is the deal with the farm pilot episode anyway?
话说那个农场试播集到底是怎么回事？

728
00:31:30.030 --> 00:31:31.210
Are we all in that episode?
我们都会参演那一集吗？

729
00:31:31.470 --> 00:31:33.510
Do we work one day and then it's all Dwight?
我们是不是只工作一天，然后就全都是德怀特的戏了？

730
00:31:34.010 --> 00:31:35.890
Jenna, you wrote back, they won't confirm.
珍娜，你回信说，他们不肯确认。

731
00:31:36.110 --> 00:31:36.830
I was told.
我当时被告知。

732
00:31:37.270 --> 00:31:38.330
This is very funny.
这太搞笑了。

733
00:31:38.470 --> 00:31:39.910
I've already researched this.
我其实已经查过这事了。

734
00:31:40.430 --> 00:31:44.570
I was told I'm only in the cold open and would only shoot one day and then have like five
我被告知我只出现在冷场开场里，而且只拍一天，然后大概有五天

735
00:31:44.570 --> 00:31:45.190
days off.
假期。

736
00:31:45.390 --> 00:31:48.910
But I was also told a couple of characters go to the farm for a couple of scenes.
但我也听说有几个角色会去农场拍几场戏。

737
00:31:49.150 --> 00:31:50.110
I don't know who.
我不知道是谁。

738
00:31:50.810 --> 00:31:51.030
So.
所以。

739
00:31:51.250 --> 00:31:53.290
I love how you check in with me.
我喜欢你向我核实情况的样子。

740
00:31:53.490 --> 00:31:53.750
I know.
我知道。

741
00:31:53.750 --> 00:31:54.470
About the schedule.
关于日程的事。

742
00:31:54.750 --> 00:31:57.390
But I also would know that you had already looked into it.
但我其实早就知道你已经查过了。

743
00:31:57.390 --> 00:31:58.370
I'd already looked into it.
我早就查过了。

744
00:31:58.370 --> 00:32:00.350
Well, we clearly did get that time off.
好吧，我们显然确实得到了那些假期。

745
00:32:00.490 --> 00:32:03.470
And my third Digital Clutter email explains what we were doing.
而我的第三封数字杂物箱邮件解释了我们在做什么。

746
00:32:03.610 --> 00:32:04.430
I'll share that later.
我稍后会分享。

747
00:32:04.750 --> 00:32:05.430
I love it.
我太喜欢了。

748
00:32:05.590 --> 00:32:07.970
Well, now we're going to go back to Dunder Mifflin.
好了，现在我们要回到邓德·米夫林。

749
00:32:08.070 --> 00:32:13.410
And this will start the added storyline of Todd Packer coming in with his cupcakes.
这将开启托德·帕克带着纸杯蛋糕登场的新剧情线。

750
00:32:14.090 --> 00:32:18.010
This scene has two of my favorite Pam moments in the episode.
这一场戏里有我在这集中最喜欢的两个帕姆的高光时刻。

751
00:32:18.470 --> 00:32:22.810
The first one, when Clark asks who Todd is and Pam just goes, bad.
第一个是当克拉克问托德是谁时，帕姆直接来了句，真差劲。

752
00:32:23.770 --> 00:32:25.110
Jenna, you're so funny.
珍娜，你太搞笑了。

753
00:32:25.350 --> 00:32:25.750
Thank you.
谢谢你。

754
00:32:25.750 --> 00:32:28.350
And then Todd addresses the bullpen.
然后托德对大办公室的员工们说话。

755
00:32:28.510 --> 00:32:29.790
He says, you know what?
他说，你们知道吗？

756
00:32:29.910 --> 00:32:33.830
I'm working through the steps of Alcoholics Anonymous and Narcotics Anonymous.
我正在经历匿名戒酒互助会和匿名戒毒互助会的步骤。

757
00:32:34.070 --> 00:32:35.530
He's there to make amends.
他是来寻求原谅并弥补过错的。

758
00:32:36.030 --> 00:32:41.110
He goes around the room and he starts apologizing to everyone, but actually insulting everyone.
他绕着房间开始向每个人道歉，但实际上是在侮辱每一个人。

759
00:32:41.410 --> 00:32:44.070
And this is my second favorite moment from Pam.
这是我最喜欢的帕姆的第二个高光时刻。

760
00:32:44.290 --> 00:32:48.310
She goes, Todd, you're just saying insults in the form of an apology.
她说，托德，你只是把侮辱人的话包装成了道歉的形式。

761
00:32:52.790 --> 00:32:54.710
Yes, this was really fun to shoot.
是的，这场戏拍起来真的很有趣。

762
00:32:54.890 --> 00:32:58.830
I always enjoyed Todd Packer, even though none of our characters enjoyed Todd Packer.
我一直很喜欢托德·帕克，尽管我们剧里的角色没有一个人喜欢他。

763
00:32:58.850 --> 00:33:01.270
He definitely shakes everything up.
他确实把一切都搅得天翻地覆。

764
00:33:01.430 --> 00:33:01.970
He does.
没错。

765
00:33:02.290 --> 00:33:03.630
It's such a fun energy.
这种活力真是有趣极了。

766
00:33:03.930 --> 00:33:10.110
This is when Todd Packer is going to announce that he has brought cupcakes for everyone from nipples.
这段是托德·帕克准备宣布他给大家带了乳头点心。

767
00:33:10.150 --> 00:33:13.470
I mean nibbles at the Steamtown Mall.
我是说斯蒂姆敦购物中心的尼布尔斯点心店。

768
00:33:14.090 --> 00:33:20.050
But Pam thinks everybody should have a private conversation before they accept this apology and eat their cupcake.
但帕姆认为每个人在接受这个道歉并吃纸杯蛋糕之前，都应该先私下聊聊。

769
00:33:20.050 --> 00:33:23.190
I do love that Pam is the one that says, it's nibbles.
我真的很喜欢是帕姆指出那是尼布尔斯点心。

770
00:33:23.610 --> 00:33:25.150
Yeah, exactly.
是的，完全正确。

771
00:33:25.810 --> 00:33:29.070
Well, back at the farm, the funeral has begun, the graveside service.
好吧，镜头回到农场，葬礼已经开始了，墓地悼词仪式正在进行。

772
00:33:29.390 --> 00:33:31.970
And we have a guest star callback.
我们有一个客串演员回归了。

773
00:33:32.170 --> 00:33:34.730
Michael Tuba Heatherton is back.
迈克尔·图巴·希瑟顿又回来了。

774
00:33:35.210 --> 00:33:38.970
Tuba just cracks me up how many times we kept bringing him back.
图巴真的把我笑死了，我们竟然这么多次把他请回来。

775
00:33:39.070 --> 00:33:40.210
In different roles.
而且扮演不同的角色。

776
00:33:40.430 --> 00:33:40.690
Yes.
没错。

777
00:33:40.810 --> 00:33:41.810
He's now a minister.
他现在是个牧师了。

778
00:33:42.110 --> 00:33:46.550
Season seven, he was in Andy's play as part of the cast for Sweeney Todd.
第七季里，他作为《理发师陶德》剧组的演员参演了安迪的戏剧。

779
00:33:46.550 --> 00:33:48.590
Possible that he was a minister.
可能他本来就是个牧师吧。

780
00:33:49.470 --> 00:33:50.450
Maybe so.
也许是吧。

781
00:33:50.590 --> 00:33:50.990
You're right.
你说的对。

782
00:33:51.230 --> 00:33:51.550
